  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1907\">\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1554\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1552\">MYEOV/IgH Rearrangement Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1907\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1686\">\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1686\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1618\">MYEOV gene involvement with IgH translocation</strong>, associated with <strong data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1683\">multiple myeloma and plasma cell dyscrasias</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1767\">\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1767\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May have <strong data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1727\">prognostic implications</strong> (often linked to aggressive disease).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1907\">\n<p data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1907\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Should be correlated with <strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1906\">clinical findings, bone marrow morphology, other cytogenetics (t(11;14), del(17p), etc.), and NGS panels</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2037\">\n<p data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1930\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1928\">Not Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2037\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1976\">\n<p data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1976\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No evidence of MYEOV/IgH rearrangement.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2037\">\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2037\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Does not exclude other myeloma-associated abnormalities.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
